  "steps": [
    "Prepare a purée with boiled palak, chillies and coriander.",
    "Add some ghee in a pan, then add jeera, garlic, chillies. After a min add chopped onion. Let it brown and then add the curd. After this add all the masalas. Let it cook for 2 mins and add the palak purée. Cover and cook for 5 mins and add the boiled peas, along with a dash of water and wheat flour. Add the paneer, milk and sugar, add some kasturi methi and cook for 5 mins."
  ],
